  <h2 id="courses">Courses built for deaf students, and who they are for</h2>

  <p>
    India has a small set of courses written for deaf and hard-of-hearing students and for the people
    who work with them. Read the fine print on who each one is for.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Course</th>
          <th>Length</th>
          <th>Who it is for</th>
          <th>Where it leads</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {courseRows.map((row) => (
