          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Course details are from the ISLRTC website and the Ali Yavar Jung National Institute of Speech and
    Hearing Disabilities admission notice for 2025-26, read on 30 October 2026. Seats, dates and entry
    rules change every year, so confirm in the current notice.
  </p>

  <h3>The sign language careers, in plain words</h3>

  <p>
    There are two separate jobs here. Teaching ISL is for deaf people who sign fluently. Interpreting
    is for hearing people who sign well.
  </p>

  <p>
    A news report in 2022 quoted an interpreters' association founder saying interpreter pay is roughly
    Rs 25,000 to Rs 45,000 a month or more, and Rs 750 to Rs 1,000 an hour for freelancers. Treat that
    as one person's estimate. ISLRTC itself says a job is not guaranteed after the diploma.
  </p>

  <h2 id="routes">Eight routes, strongest growth first</h2>

  <p>
    Routes are ordered by how far proof of skill can lift income, and the rank-based route comes
    last. Each card names who pays, the main hurdle and the next move.
  </p>

  <div class="route-grid">
    {routes.map((r) => (
      <div class="route-card">
        <div class="route-card__top">
          <span class="route-card__n">{r.n}</span>
