  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Get the certificate and UDID if you lack them, then write down the access you will request at school
    or college. Choose two routes and start one real piece of work.
  </p>

  <p>
    A specialist can weigh your marks, strengths, budget and family situation with you, which cuts the
    guesswork. A sensible first step is
    <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/career-counselling-after-12th/">career counselling after 12th</a>.
    The aim is skills that pay well and an earlier path to financial freedom, not only a job title.
  </p>

